{"t": 1794115212.8700833, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline #8812 on `main` is red because the `test:contract` job fails in `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format`:\n\n```\nassert invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"\nE  AssertionError: assert 'INV-2026-42' == 'INV-2026-000042'\n```\n\nRoot cause: `billing/invoice.py` formatted the sequence without padding, so it emitted `INV-2026-42`. The contract test enforces the Finance ERP import format from FIN-77, where the sequence part is zero-padded to 6 digits (ERP v2 format).\n\nFix: format the sequence with `:06d`:\n\n```python\ndef invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n```\n\nThis produces `INV-2026-000042` as required and resolves the only failing job in the pipeline (`lint` already passes).", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
